%global debug_package %{nil}
%global _build_id_links none
%global __os_install_post %{nil}

Name:           psf-security-packages
Version:        @DATEVER@
Release:        @REV@
Summary:        PrivacySafe security checks, hunts and interim mitigations
License:        CC0-1.0
URL:            https://codeberg.org/PrivacySafe/security-patches
Source0:        %{name}-%{version}-%{release}.tar.gz
BuildArch:      noarch
AutoReqProv:    no
Requires:       bash >= 4.0
Requires:       coreutils
Packager:       @MAINT@
Vendor:         PrivacySafe Foundation

%description
Free public domain tools for GNU/Linux servers: check whether you are
exposed, hunt for signs of exploitation, and apply interim mitigations where
the vendor fix is not enough. Covers PHP2Shell (CVE-2026-109618 and
CVE-2026-109619), Nextcloud Collabora, nginx, curl, Brotli, libheif, Ruby
and GitLab, Plex, LiteLLM, GhostAction and more.

Everything installs under /opt/psf-security-patches, plus the
php2shell-watch systemd unit, which is not enabled automatically. Patching
is the fix: these tools reduce risk while you patch and help you find out
whether you were hit.

Built and published by PrivacySafe Foundation 501(c)(3) nonprofit with the
assistance of Ivy Cyber LLC, under CC0 1.0 Universal. If this software is
helpful, please consider a donation to PrivacySafe Foundation:
https://privacysafe.foundation

%prep
%setup -q -n %{name}-%{version}-%{release}

%build

%install
rm -rf %{buildroot}
install -d %{buildroot}/opt/psf-security-patches
cp -a . %{buildroot}/opt/psf-security-patches/
rm -rf %{buildroot}/opt/psf-security-patches/packaging \
       %{buildroot}/opt/psf-security-patches/.gitattributes
find %{buildroot}/opt/psf-security-patches -type d -exec chmod 0755 {} +
find %{buildroot}/opt/psf-security-patches -type f -exec chmod 0644 {} +
find %{buildroot}/opt/psf-security-patches -type f -name '*.sh' -exec chmod 0755 {} +
install -D -m 0644 packaging/systemd/php2shell-watch.service \
    %{buildroot}/usr/lib/systemd/system/php2shell-watch.service

%files
%defattr(-,root,root,-)
%license LICENSE NOTICE
%doc README.md CHANGELOG.md
/opt/psf-security-patches
/usr/lib/systemd/system/php2shell-watch.service

%changelog
* @RPMDATE@ @MAINT@ - @DATEVER@-@REV@
- Release of PrivacySafe Security Patches. See CHANGELOG.md for details.
